  <item>
    <title>09.Deadline超能力：让效率翻倍的神秘力量</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6735f865f373fe5d4d525296</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6735f865f373fe5d4d525296</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 15 Nov 2024 09:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>游走在班儿上的我们，谁还没被DDL（deadline）扼住过喉咙。</span></p><span></span><p><span>被称为“第一生产力”的DDL，对有些人来说，是亦师亦友的帮手，而对有些人来说，它是焦虑情绪的缔造者；有些人善于运用它，条理自己的工作生活，而有些人喜欢挑衅它，表达对不合理安排的抗争。</span></p><span></span><p><span>不同人面对DDL有不同的处理方式，我们今天就来聊聊自己如何应对“上级”给我们的“死线”。也欢迎大家在评论区留言，分享自己在时间管理、DDL应对的心态或做法。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="21">00:21</a> 收到不合理的DDL只想比中指</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="52">00:52</a> DDL给的超能力：交作业前2小时写完3篇作文，作品超乎寻常的优异</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="247">04:07</a> 清晨5点起来写方案：“这方案不到最后一刻，我没想法啊！”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="381">06:21</a> 又压线！半天搞定一个方案，客户买单成交了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="454">07:34</a> 先甜后苦，还是先苦后甜，这个人生哲理也能延续到面对DDL的态度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="557">09:17</a> 在客户给的DDL上自己再叠加DDL，这是什么怪病？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="809">13:29</a> DDL制定及执行典范：高数小白从0到99分的大逆袭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="913">15:13</a> 但凡没个DDL排期表，这婚礼还真办不了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1136">18:56</a> DDL的由来竟然真与生死有关</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1202">20:02</a> “人类之光”DDL生来是为了解决拖延症的啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span>不同的拖延症状，你中了几个</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1234">20:34</a> 畏难型拖延</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1244">20:44</a> 狗熊型拖延</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1282">21:22</a> 宕机型拖延</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1321">22:01</a> 鼓励型拖延（找刺激型拖延）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1635">27:15</a> 实验证明，DDL真的可以提高人的效率？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1688">28:08</a> DDL给你的生理不适，是为你小宇宙爆发而燃烧的血槽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2207">36:47</a> 打脸了？！又有新理论：DDL其实并不提高效率？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2321">38:41</a> DDL是提高效率的利器，还是降低效率的绊脚石，取决于你对结果的把控</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2409">40:09</a> 踩了十几年的DDL边界线，还是踩空了那么几脚</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2426">40:26</a> 以为成功会有惯性，结果没想到，最后一刻它刹车了</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2923">48:43</a> 给了2个月的投标准备期，投标小白最后3天kuku一顿垂死赶标</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3687">61:27</a> 制定DDL的小技巧</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：橘子姑娘、徐玲</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：ROSE,Bruno Mars-APT</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrK-KCnlh9v6GFoUudrnRNuDSrdN.m4a" length="127080803" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:05:49</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgNbsjnzMoERyJ1hIRBfPvxDzuta.png"/>
